ent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**I'm submitting a ...**\n\n```\n[x] bug report\n[ ] feature request\n```\n\n**Current behavior**\n\nWhen animating a transition from `void` to a defined state and delaying this animation, the styling set before the animation is only applied once the delay is over.\n\n**Expected/desired behavior**\n\nThe styling set before the animation should be applied immediately and be held until the actual animation starts to prevent flashing.\n\n**Reproduction of the problem**\n\nThe code below describes a parallel in/out animation. One box moves in, the other moves out at the same time. (A little bit like a traditional airport departure board.) Since the two should not overlap, the in animation (`void => someState`) needs to be delayed. However, the void element (the one animating in) stays visible until the animation starts, is then hidden instantly, only to start animating in again.\n\n```\n        transition('void => someState', [\n            style({\n                transform: 'rotateX(90deg)',\n            }),\n            animate('400ms 400ms ease-out')\n        ]),\n        transition('someState => void', [\n            animate('400ms ease-in', style({\n                transform: 'rotateX(90deg)',\n            }))\n        ]),\n```\n\nTrying to style `void` as well does not work.\n\n**Please tell us about your environment:**\n- **Angular version: 2.0.0-rc.2**\n- **Browser: Chrome 50.0.2661.102**\n- **Language: TypeScript 1.8.10**\n","closed_by":{"login":"matsko","id":93018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko","html_url":"https://github.com/matsko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/9326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/9326/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}